1
00:00:11,401 --> 00:00:17,401
I ran the whole cycle - from numbers to feel,

2
00:00:17,441 --> 00:00:23,542
From deals to the meaning, from fear to what’s real.

3
00:00:23,602 --> 00:00:29,602
The world didn’t collapse - it just changed its interface.

4
00:00:29,662 --> 00:00:35,563
And I’m here inside it. No mask. No fear. My face.

5
00:00:35,823 --> 00:00:38,903
We walked through the fire - charts, wars, and nerves,

6
00:00:38,923 --> 00:00:41,883
Where breathing is betting, where pressure curves.

7
00:00:41,963 --> 00:00:44,684
I watched all the systems and blueprints fall,

8
00:00:44,944 --> 00:00:47,644
But faith stayed standing - no walls at all.

9
00:00:47,904 --> 00:00:50,724
They were building fear, I was building a home,

10
00:00:51,044 --> 00:00:53,764
Out of words, out of love, out of nights not alone.

11
00:00:54,044 --> 00:00:56,845
Now it’s quiet - not dead, just a different phase,

12
00:00:57,065 --> 00:01:00,045
Not the end of the road, just a slower pace.

13
00:01:00,225 --> 00:01:06,085
The world’s been rebooted - and I’m alive,

14
00:01:06,225 --> 00:01:10,946
No anger, no pain, just a clearer drive.

15
00:01:11,166 --> 00:01:17,026
As long as people believe, it won’t fall apart,

16
00:01:17,206 --> 00:01:35,208
The world really starts where the human hearts start.

17
00:01:36,928 --> 00:01:39,968
Some call it a “new era”, headlines and signs,

18
00:01:40,348 --> 00:01:42,968
I call it simple - belief, no designs.

19
00:01:43,068 --> 00:01:45,828
No indexes, no currencies, no trends,

20
00:01:46,088 --> 00:01:48,909
Just heart, just family, stories and friends.

21
00:01:49,169 --> 00:01:51,849
The stake went down, but the soul went up,

22
00:01:52,209 --> 00:01:55,089
We’re back together - that’s the toast in my cup.

23
00:01:55,149 --> 00:01:58,029
Not for profit, not likes, not digital fame,

24
00:01:58,329 --> 00:02:01,130
But memory - untouched by interest and gain.

25
00:02:01,370 --> 00:02:05,990
The world’s been rebooted - and I’m alive,

26
00:02:07,310 --> 00:02:12,171
No anger, no pain, just a clearer drive.

27
00:02:12,291 --> 00:02:18,171
As long as people believe, it won’t fall apart,

28
00:02:19,751 --> 00:02:24,512
The world really starts where the human hearts start.

29
00:02:25,392 --> 00:02:41,033
I’m not a saint - I’m just worn from the grind,

30
00:02:41,233 --> 00:02:43,873
From endless “buy” and “sell” in the back of my mind.

31
00:02:44,153 --> 00:02:47,013
But I learned, my brother - nothing was waste,

32
00:02:47,153 --> 00:02:49,874
Every drawdown hides a return to base.

33
00:02:50,154 --> 00:02:53,054
Now I breathe, I don’t chase every percent,

34
00:02:53,434 --> 00:02:56,094
I live like a trader - but with a different intent:

35
00:02:56,634 --> 00:02:59,314
Feelings, meaning, the ones who stay near,

36
00:02:59,554 --> 00:03:02,375
As long as they’re with me - I won’t disappear.

37
00:03:02,995 --> 00:03:05,155
And if tomorrow it all breaks again,

38
00:03:05,515 --> 00:03:08,435
I’ll rebuild it quietly - no panic, no pain.

39
00:03:08,715 --> 00:03:11,255
The world isn’t numbers - it’s living and true,

40
00:03:11,755 --> 00:03:14,556
As long as someone loves, as long as there’s a view.

41
00:03:15,296 --> 00:03:17,736
We didn’t lose - we woke up inside,

42
00:03:18,076 --> 00:03:20,716
Didn’t collapse - we simply returned alive.

43
00:03:20,896 --> 00:03:23,736
The trader’s matrix closed, no password, no key,

44
00:03:23,756 --> 00:03:27,477
Now I know - the code was the heart and the will in me.

